Package: MatchDT
Title: Matched Analysis of Temporal Disease Trajectories (Match-DT)
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A statistically based algorithm that can be applied to EHRs of
    different sizes and types — Matched Analysis of Temporal Disease
    Trajectories (Match-DT). Cohort-agnostic R workflow to prepare EHR tables,
    estimate matched relative-risk disease-to-cancer trajectories, and plot RR
    versus mean diagnosis lag. Includes a seeded dummy-data generator for testing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    readr,
    yaml,
    jsonlite,
    optparse,
    stringr,
    MatchIt,
    ggplot2,
    ggrepel
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    shiny
